et":"https://idahocapitalsun.com/2026/03/31/idaho-governor-signs-bill-to-criminalize-trans-people-using-bathrooms-that-align-with-their-identity/","line":312},{"title":"Elyse Thorpe holds a framed photo of May.","target":"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit-560w,f_avif,q_auto:eco,dpr_2/rockcms/2026-07/260717-elyse-may-pollard-cs-b0c167.jpg","line":320,"embedded":true},{"title":"*988lifeline.org*","target":"http://988lifeline.org/","line":324},{"title":"*SpeakingOfSuicide.com/resources*","target":"http://speakingofsuicide.com/resources","line":324}],"metadata":{"title":"Idaho pushed anti-trans laws for years. Then a teen died.","source":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/idaho-pushed-anti-trans-laws-transition-care-bathroom-trump-rcna350199","author":["[[Jo Yurcaba]]"],"published":"2026-07-18","created":"2026-07-22","description":"The life and death of May Pollard, 16, provides a window into the tragic effect that legislation and political rhetoric have had on trans people in America.","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},